### 4. Competitor Analysis & Omission Exploitation
- **Supplied Competitor URL:** `https://www.caratlane.com/jewellery/chains-for+men.html`
- **Competitor Structure Identified:** CaratLane's PLP targets men's chains with basic length breakdowns (20-22 inches), minimal karatage mentions (22K vs platinum), and 5 brief generic FAQs.
- **BlueStone Differentiators & Content Parity:**
  - CaratLane omitted in-depth weave architecture: BlueStone systematically dissects Curb, Cuban, Figaro, Franco, Rope, Wheat/Spiga, Box, and Byzantine links.
  - CaratLane omitted solid vs hollow engineering: BlueStone analyzes tensile rigidity, dent risk, and repairability for active daily wear.
  - CaratLane omitted regulatory hallmarking standards: BlueStone explains the Bureau of Indian Standards (BIS) 3-part hallmark and 6-digit alphanumeric HUID verification on the BIS CARE app.
  - CaratLane lacked outfit pairings: BlueStone provides specific styling formulas for business formal (suits/spread collars), casual streetwear (crewneck/linen), and Indian ethnic wear (kurtas/bandhgalas).

